 dinners, kids at play, or evenings under the stars, while the terraced hillside rises beyond, creating a beautiful backdrop. There's plenty of room for all the pieces of everyday life, too, with a three-car garage plus additional storage, EV charger and solar to help make sunny Southern California days work a little harder for you. Other updates include a tankless water heater and newer HVAC. And when adventure calls, you're just minutes from Castaic Lake, neighborhood parks, hiking, recreation and the wide-open spaces that make this part of Santa Clarita so special. Fresh, bright and surrounded by nature, 28602 Heather Lane feels less like simply buying a house and more like finding your own little corner of California to call home.", "remarksLength": 1491, "listedBy": "Sean Hughes", "propertyTypeName": "Single Family Residential", "totalSqft": 1959, "history": [{"date": "2026-09-17", "event": "Price Changed", "price": 789000, "source": "TheMLS"}, {"date": "2026-09-08", "event": "Listed", "price": 810000, "source": "TheMLS"}, {"date": "2020-02-06", "event": "Sold (MLS)", "price": 585000, "source": "CRMLS"}, {"date": "2020-02-06", "event": "Sold (Public Records)", "price": 585000, "source": "Public Records"}, {"date": "2020-01-10", "event": "Contingent", "price": null, "source": "CRMLS"}, {"date": "2019-11-04", "event": "Listed", "price": 595000, "source": "CRMLS"}, {"date": "2003-03-18", "event": "Sold (Public Records)", "price": 345000, "source": "Public Records"}, {"date": "2001-03-09", "event": "Sold (Public Records)", "price": 260000, "source": "Public Records"}, {"date": "1994-01-14", "event": "Sold (Public Records)", "price": 193000, "source": "Public Records"}, {"date": "1989-08-08", "event": "Sold (Public Records)", "price": 280000, "source": "Public Records"}], "openHouses": 0, "similarActive": [{"address": "29718 Calle La Roca", "city": "Santa Clarita", "zip": "91354", "price": 1079990, "sqft": 3421, "ppsf": 316, "beds": 4, "baths": 3.5, "dom": 43, "stat